rface-variant">¿Ya tenés cuenta? <a class="text-secondary font-bold" href="<%=request.getContextPath()%>/app?view=login">Iniciar sesión →</a></p></div></section></main><footer class="w-full bg-surface-container-low py-space-xl mt-space-xl"><div class="w-full px-margin flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-space-md"><div class="flex items-center gap-space-sm"><div class="w-6 h-6 rounded bg-primary flex items-center justify-center"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[14px]">emoji_events</span></div><span class="font-headline-md text-headline-md uppercase text-on-surface">BRACKET ARENA</span></div><div class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant text-center">© 2026 Bracket Arena Technologies. Sistema Profesional de Gestión de Torneos Eliminatorios.</div><div class="flex items-center gap-space-md font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant uppercase"><a class="hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" href="#">Reglamento</a><a class="hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" href="#">Soporte</a><a class="hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" href="#">API Torneo</a></div></div></footer><script>window.ARENA_BASE = '<%=request.getContextPath()%>';</script><script defer="" src="<%=request.getContextPath()%>/js/stitch-runtime.js?v=2026-11-25-navbar-r2"></script></body></html>